 "text": "Treasurer | Clinton County Missouri\nSkip to primary content\nClinton County Missouri\nOfficial Website of Clinton County, MO\nSearch\nMain menu\nHome\nCommunities\nCameron\nGower\nHolt\nLathrop\nOsborn\nPlattsburg\nTrimble\nTurney\nInvest\nResources\nCalendar of Events\nLinks\nCameron School District\nEast Buchanan School District\nLathrop School District\nPlattsburg School District\nVisitors\nRecreation & Outdoors\nHistory & Museums\nFairs & Festivals\nGovernment\nCounty Officials\nAssessor\nCircuit Court Clerk\nCollector\nCommissioners\nCounty Clerk’s Office\nPublic Documents\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Administrator\nRecorder of Deeds\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nCounty Departments\nEmergency Management\nPlanning and Zoning\nOrdinances & Forms\nPublic Notices\nRoad & Bridge\nHealth Department\nCourts\nClinton County Circuit Court\nJuvenile Office\nFAQs\nElection Info\nEmployment\nTreasurer\nRita Terwilleger\nTerm: Elected 2019\nPhone: 816-539-3724\nHours: 8:30 – 4:30 (Lunch from 12 to 1)\nMailing Address: 207 N. Main, Rm. 113, Plattsburg, MO 64477\nEmail: treasoffice@clintoncomo.gov\nStaff list:\nBecky Black, Deputy Treasurer\nDuties: The County Treasurer is responsible for all revenues paid to the county and keeps records of receipts/expenditures. Our office is also the custodian of school funds and disburses tax revenue to local entities, such as fire and ambulance districts.\nThe County Treasurer manages the bank accounts, makes bank deposits, and reconciles each bank account for the county, including tracking funds and keeping daily/monthly records.\nRita Terwillger, Treasurer\nLegal Statement\nPrivacy Statement\nProudly powered by WordPress\n&placement=right&parentOrigin=https://clintoncomo.org&mobile=0\" style=\"width: 255px; height: 271.484px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; position: fixed; right: 20px; left: unset; bottom: 60px; z-index: 10000;\">",
